///
/// An action sheet must have a non-null value for at least one of the
/// following arguments: [actions], [title], [message], or [cancelButton].
///
/// Generally, action sheets are used to give the user a choice between
/// two or more choices for the current context.␀␀À␀šÀ␀™æ€®À␀š€’/// An optional title of the action sheet. When the [message] is non-null,
/// the font of the [title] is bold.
///
/// Typically a [Text] widget.␀À␀›5À␀š™€£À␀›5€…/// An optional descriptive message that provides more details about the
/// reason for the alert.
///
/// Typically a [Text] widget.␀À␀›âÀ␀›A€¨À␀›â€†/// The set of actions that are displayed for the user to select.
///
/// This must be a list of [CupertinoActionSheetAction] widgets.␀À␀œíÀ␀›îÀ␀œí€Ü/// A scroll controller that can be used to control the scrolling of the
/// [message] in the action sheet.
///
